<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - One tender of A$40 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - One tender of A$40 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
